This distribution contains no Texas Instruments CC2564C service pack. The
simulation profile (BOARD_CONFIG=simulation) builds and runs without it. The
hardware profile fetches the unmodified service pack and its licence from TI's
git repository at build time, pinned by commit and SHA-256, into the ignored
.local/ directory. That file and any image built from it are governed by TI's
licence, which limits use to TI devices and forbids reverse engineering; they
are not covered by the project MIT or Apache licences.

The NuttX and NuttX Apps gitlinks are external build dependencies. Their own
licence and NOTICE files govern them. The configured firmware disables optional
BSD components; the complete upstream repositories include other optional
licences and are not relicensed by this project.
